@startuml usecase
title COLORS Web App - Use Case Diagram
left to right direction

actor "User" as user
actor "MySQL Database\n(COP4331)" as db <<system>>

rectangle "COLORS Web Application" {
  usecase "Log In" as UC1
  usecase "Search Colors" as UC2
  usecase "Add Color" as UC3
  usecase "Log Out" as UC4
  usecase "Show Login Error" as UC6
}

user --> UC1
user --> UC2
user --> UC3
user --> UC4

UC6 ..> UC1 : <<extend>>\n[invalid login]

UC1 --> db
UC2 --> db
UC3 --> db

note right of user
  No registration use case:
  users are inserted directly
  into the Users table.
end note
note bottom of UC2
  color.html runs readCookie() once on page load
  and redirects to index.html if no userId is found.
  Search and Add use that userId.
end note
@enduml
